			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 24, DX 13, IQ 4, HT 13, HP 24, WILL 8, PER 9, FP 13, SPEED 6.5, MOVE 9, DODGE 9, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
