		{
			"id": "nedNNF6rAQZvCVJZ3",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Saber-Toothed Tiger (SRD 5.1). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
